	(text "HOST_5V and USB_VBUS are isolated by LM66100 continuous-output ORing (TI Fig.17).\nU21 ST drives U22 CE; R108 pulls this node to HOST_5V. Power-source selection is separate from PLAY priority."
  (exclude_from_sim no)
  (at 15 18 0)
  (effects
    (font
      (size 1.3 1.3)
    )
    (justify left top)
  )
  (uuid "4dca5412-ceef-5eb3-a59a-50eac09b154f")
)
	(text "USB 2.0 firmware: remain <100mA until configured, advertise required current, observe suspend limits.\nCT=100pF: nominal reset-release delay about 1.07ms, plus PLAY RC delay; first host access timing is UNVERIFIED.\nSENS remains tied to HOST_5V: scope HOST_CS / HOST_OE_N against SYS_READY and verify valid data at first access."
  (exclude_from_sim no)
  (at 15 264 0)
  (effects
    (font
      (size 1.1 1.1)
    )
    (justify left top)
  )
  (uuid "88008600-c185-5bd4-b679-33ced8386f2e")
)

